  "id": "linux-nvidia-dgx-spark-ling32-air-atlas",
  "name": "DGX Spark Ling-3.2-air Atlas (SparkLing 0.1.0)",
  "version": 1,
  "options": {
    "weights": {
      "description": "Which checkpoint the engine serves: spark is Primitive AI's NVFP4A16 with NVFP4 prefill and decode and the checkpoint's own MTP drafter; strict is inclusionAI's original dynamic FP8 as published, without drafting.",
      "default": "spark",
      "values": {
        "spark": {
          "description": "primitive-ai/Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16 (MIT, about 78 GB): NVFP4 routed experts with BF16 activations. SparkLing's Spark defaults: NVFP4 prefill (expert activations for large prompt batches) and NVFP4 decode (attention projections), the published BF16 vocabulary head, and the checkpoint's one-token MTP predictor as the drafter.",
          "variables": {
            "sparklingMode": "spark",
            "modelRepo": "primitive-ai/Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16",
            "modelRevision": "3a78e58506316b5b9b7d06037910c3f4abdd291f",
            "modelDir": "primitive-ai--Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16",
            "sparklingDrafter": "mtp",
            "sparklingQuant": "publisher",
            "prefillPrecision": "nvfp4",
            "decodePrecision": "nvfp4",
            "weightsTitle": "Spark NVFP4A16"
          }
        },
        "strict": {
          "description": "inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air (MIT, about 129 GB): the original dynamic block-FP8 checkpoint with its BF16 and FP32 exceptions, checkpoint precision, the published sampling defaults and template, no drafting. Atlas pages experts from disk to fit one Spark.",
          "variables": {
            "sparklingMode": "strict",
            "modelRepo": "inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air",
            "modelRevision": "ff099487f6f57165e6fa9386ad61fddfafc78b76",
            "modelDir": "inclusionAI--Ling-3.2-air",
            "sparklingDrafter": "none",
            "sparklingQuant": "publisher",
            "prefillPrecision": "checkpoint",
            "decodePrecision": "checkpoint",
            "weightsTitle": "Strict FP8"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "summary": "inclusionAI's Ling-3.2-air (124B MoE, 5.5B active) on one DGX Spark with SparkLing 0.1.0's Atlas build: text, image and video input, tools, reasoning, prefix caching, 131,072-token requests (262,144 in the max mode). --weights spark (default) serves Primitive AI's NVFP4A16 with NVFP4 prefill and decode and the checkpoint's MTP drafter; --weights strict serves the original FP8. Three modes: default (8 requests), saver (1 request of 8,192 tokens) and max (16 requests). Additive only: no default model, no aliases.",
  "description": "This recipe installs SparkLing 0.1.0 at the immutable product revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkling/pins-0.1.0.json. The Atlas engine image is built from Enntity/SparkLing by install/build.sh and published to GHCR; LLooM commits no engine source. Setup acquires the selected checkpoint at its pinned revision (primitive-ai/Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16 for spark, inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air for strict), pulls the image by its manifest digest and verifies it, then runs SparkLing's own install/check_files.py with install/checkpoint.json, fetched at the pinned revision, digest-checked and run inside the image with no network, to check every inference file against its pinned size and hash. Nothing is assembled: the engine serves the checkpoint directory as downloaded. Setup remembers the weights it installed with.",
  "license": {
    "id": "MIT",
    "name": "Recipe metadata, launcher and orchestration"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "lloom",
    "generatedBy": "manual-curated",
    "source": "SparkLing 0.1.0: Enntity/SparkLing 46afd596505480a370392f2dc88ea36644e519b7 (tag v0.1.0, install tree a66a1e6464f475f033d7bfc8b2b3a6ac75c65bf4), engine Enntity/atlas ling/3.2-air @ dc0035de58878ff8b339cb8e0692b48f45398d1f (AGPL-3.0-only, recorded in the image's /opt/atlas/source-manifest.json). Image ghcr.io/enntity/atlas-sparkling:a66a1e6464f4 (also :0.1.0), addressed by its GHCR manifest digest. Profiles default.json (0.80 GPU memory utilization, 8 sequences, 131072 tokens), saver.json (0.70, 1, 8192) and max.json (0.88, 16, 262144), all with BF16 KV, prefix caching and ffmpeg video decoding. Checkpoints primitive-ai/Ling-3.2-air-NVFP4A16 revision 3a78e58506316b5b9b7d06037910c3f4abdd291f (MIT) and inclusionAI/Ling-3.2-air revision ff099487f6f57165e6fa9386ad61fddfafc78b76 (MIT), each checked against SparkLing's install/checkpoint.json."
  },
